1 ) high temperature in Seattle each day


Code
library(vegawidget)


Warning: package 'vegawidget' was built under R version 4.3.3


Code
'
{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json",
  "data": {
    "url": "https://calvin-data304.netlify.app/data/weather-with-dates.csv"
  },
  "height": 200,
  "width": 500,
  "mark": "line",

  "encoding": {
    "x": {
      "field": "date",
      "type": "temporal",
      "timeUnit": "monthdate",
      "title": "Month"
    },
    "y": {
      "field": "temp_max", 
      "type": "quantitative", 
      "title": "Mean Temperature"
    },
    "color": {"field": "year"},
    "opacity": {"value": 0.5}
  }
}' |&gt; as_vegaspec()








2) mean temperature for each month
The graphic should show 12 months.
My first graph: separating each year by color


Code
'{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega-lite/v5.json",
  "data": {
    "url": "https://calvin-data304.netlify.app/data/weather-with-dates.csv"
  },
  "height": 200,
  "width": 500,
  "mark": "line",
  "transform": [
  {
    "calculate": "(datum.temp_max + datum.temp_min) / 2",
    "as": "temp_mean"
  }
],
  "encoding": {
    "x": {
      "field": "date",
      "type": "temporal",
      "timeUnit": "month",
      "title": "Month"
    },
    "y": {
      "field": "temp_mean",
      "type": "quantitative",
      "aggregate": "mean",
      "title": "Mean Temperature"
    },
    "color": {"field": "year"},
    "opacity": {"value": 0.7}
  }
}' |&gt; as_vegaspec()






